# An allowlist: nothing is sent to the build except what is named here.
#
# The old version listed what to leave out, so anything new sitting in the
# checkout (a media folder, a backup, a database dump) rode along into the
# build: gigabytes of "transferring context" for a site that needs a few MB.
# If the build one day cannot find a file, add it below.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!vite.config.js
!tsconfig.json
!src
!static
# Migrations, applied at startup.
!db
# One-off tools that run inside the container.
!scripts

# Inside those, still never:
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
